WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.567
-Thank you very much.
Enjoy yourself.

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.167
Welcome, everybody.
Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.434
"The Tonight Show"!
You're here!

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.033
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:09.834
Thank you for watching.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.033
Let's get to some news.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:12.968
Well, guys,
today in Washington, D.C.,

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.334
it was the deadline
for U.S. federal agencies

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:19.334
to remove TikTok
from all government devices.

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:20.634
[ Audience "Oohs" ]
Yeah.

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:22.601
And five minutes later,
inflation, climate change,

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.734
and world peace
were immediately solved.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.834 --> 00:00:29.601
Apparently, government employees
were really into TikTok today.

00:00:29.601 --> 00:00:31.834
One White House staffer finally
looked up from his phone

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:33.968
and said, "Vice President Biden,
what are you doing here?"

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:37.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.634
Some more news -- today,
President Biden held a reception

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:40.734
at the White House

00:00:40.734 --> 00:00:43.100
to celebrate
Greek Independence Day.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:48.968
Things got off to a rough start

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:51.167
when Biden was the only one
who showed up wearing a toga.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:53.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.400
But Biden did the best
he could,

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.701
although it was
kind of embarrassing

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:56.834
when he ended
his speech with,

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:58.667
"And may Zeus bless
the United States."

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.067
Guys, listen to this.
I read that the grand jury

00:01:03.067 --> 00:01:05.467
weighing charges
against former president Trump

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:07.801
over hush payments
made to Stormy Daniels

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:10.300
is taking
the next month off.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.167
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:13.567
What?
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:16.501
-Even Ted Cruz is like,
"You're going on vacation now?"

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:18.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:21.701
Yep. A potential indictment
is at least a month away.

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:23.567
Melania was like,
"Well, cancel the party."

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:25.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:28.567
Speaking of ongoing court cases,
a federal judge ruled

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:32.033
Mike Pence has to testify
in a January 6th investigation.

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:36.334
Meanwhile...
-Yeah!

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:38.033
-Meanwhile, right now,
everybody's talking about

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.901
the Gwyneth Paltrow trial.

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:42.167
And I think that
they're both dealing with

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:44.100
some pretty similar questions
on the stand.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.434
-Really?
-Yeah. For instance,

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:48.501
when a lawyer asks, "How would
you describe that day?

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:52.067
Paltrow says, "A reckless
70-year-old nearly killed me."

00:01:52.067 --> 00:01:54.200
Pence says, "A reckless
70-year-old nearly killed me."

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:57.467
See?
-Yeah.

00:01:57.467 --> 00:02:00.667
[ Applause ]

00:02:00.667 --> 00:02:02.901
Next up, when asked,
"How has the incident

00:02:02.901 --> 00:02:04.634
affected your life
going forward?"

00:02:04.634 --> 00:02:07.801
Paltrow says, "I never want to
go skiing at Deer Valley again."

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:08.934
Pence says, "I never want
to see a guy

00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:10.467
wearing deer antlers again.

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:13.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:14.968
Next up, when asked

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.334
"What did you say
when it happened?"

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.534
Paltrow said,
"I screamed the F word."

00:02:18.534 --> 00:02:21.000
Pence says, "I screamed
the F word -- fiddlesticks."

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:25.267
And finally, when asked,

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:27.634
"Have you spoken to the man
you claim is responsible?"

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.000
Paltrow said, "No,
my lawyer advised against it."

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.133
Pence said, "No,
we had a conscious uncoupling."

00:02:32.133 --> 00:02:33.234
Oh, there you...

00:02:33.234 --> 00:02:34.734
[ Laughter and applause ]
-I believe him.

00:02:34.734 --> 00:02:38.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:40.701
Well, today in Washington,
Senator Bernie Sanders

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:42.834
grilled the former C.E.O.
of Starbucks

00:02:42.834 --> 00:02:45.367
on the company's
labor practices.

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:46.767
You could tell Bernie
was really angry

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:47.868
because the volume of his voice

00:02:47.868 --> 00:02:50.133
went from tall
to grande to venti!

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:53.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:54.567
Bernie wasn't even
supposed to be there.

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:56.467
He just heard a billionaire
C.E.O. was testifying

00:02:56.467 --> 00:02:58.133
and busted in like
the Kool-Aid Man.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:00.601
"Oh, yeah!"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:02.033
Some news from overseas.

00:03:02.033 --> 00:03:04.834
King Charles' first portrait
as monarch was just released.

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:06.367
Here it is.

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:08.501
That's not bad.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.501 --> 00:03:10.734
Not bad. Can we see
a portrait of an old king?

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:11.767
I mean, there you go.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.767 --> 00:03:13.634
-Wow.
-Come on, Charles.

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:14.801
Where's the drip?

00:03:14.801 --> 00:03:16.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.901
Hey, have you guys heard
about this website?

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:21.234
It's called character.ai?

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:22.801
Uses artificial intelligence

00:03:22.801 --> 00:03:26.067
so you can have a conversation
with any historical figure.

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:27.434
It's real.

00:03:27.434 --> 00:03:29.334
Well, it was recently valued
at over a billion dollars,

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:31.300
so I thought maybe we could
try it right here on the show.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:32.334
We'll try it?

00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:35.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:35.767 --> 00:03:40.300
Character.ai,
connect me to Abraham Lincoln.

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.634
Wow. I can't believe this.
All right.

00:03:41.634 --> 00:03:43.767
Uh, hello, Mr. Lincoln.
How are you?

00:03:45.534 --> 00:03:47.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:49.334
Fam?
Let me try another question.

00:03:49.334 --> 00:03:51.133
What are you doing today?

00:03:55.767 --> 00:04:00.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.334 --> 00:04:02.067
You were a great president.

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:05.167
Your leadership was truly
an inspiration to all Americans.

00:04:07.534 --> 00:04:08.968
All right, I'm done with this.
I don't want to do this.

00:04:08.968 --> 00:04:10.467
It's broken.
Forget it.

